  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Malawi&#x2019;s Education System</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme aims to improve the quality of education service delivery in Malawi so more girls and boys successfully progress through and complete primary school with measureable improvements in learning outcomes. This will contribute towards the UK&#x2019;s efforts to support human capital development so more Malawians have the foundations and skills to fulfil their potential and contribute towards national development.</narrative>
  </description>
